      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235285/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix cranberries, brown sugar, orange juice, orange zest, and cinnamon stick together in a saucepan; bring to a boil.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/dgMrhUw-qiwdjXJ2lAvcm9gBO_s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-235285-cranberry-orange-sauce-VAT-step-02-4252dc71254d465aa00871b3c8784b99.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235285/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Reduce heat and simmer until cranberries pop and sauce is thickened, about 15 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/mLNsmXNQrSGDxJrPI4FohWt2RpQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-235285-cranberry-orange-sauce-VAT-step-03-d9ab6bec93de4b04a5078e0f40d92086.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235285/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "For best results, transfer cranberry sauce to a bowl and refrigerate until chilled, at least 1 hour.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/RfIXuN2mcZQLkHuP_84kO35QB1M=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-235285-cranberry-orange-sauce-VAT-step-04-955f33c2fe974ee0b7a1cfdce4def165.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235285/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove cinnamon stick from sauce and serve at room temperature.",
